	(text "14S 18650 BATTERY PACK ON PCB - BMS BREAKOUT / TRAINING BOARD\n- Board: A4 landscape 297 x 210 mm, 4-layer\n- 14 cells in series: 58.8V max / 50.4V nominal / 42V empty (below the 60V SELV limit)\n- Cell sense: JST XH 15-pin (B-, C1..C14) through 60V PPTCs + per-cell 5V TVS\n- Temperature: 7x 10k B3950 NTC, one between each pair of cells, JST XH 14-pin\n- Pack output: M4 lugs PACK+ (after 5x20 10A fuse) and PACK-\n- Per cell: red/black test loops + reverse-insertion LED"
